            "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-item-accessory\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/catalog/31101391\">Dominus Infernus</a></h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/0/01/Dominus_Infernus.png/revision/latest?cb=20260823193416\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Dominus Infernus\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/0/01/Dominus_Infernus.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260823193416\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/0/01/Dominus_Infernus.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260823193416 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/0/01/Dominus_Infernus.png/revision/latest?cb=20260823193416 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Dominus Infernus\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Dominus_Infernus.png\" data-image-name=\"Dominus Infernus.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"original price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Original Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Robux\" title=\"Robux\"><img alt=\"Robux\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/4/43/Robux_dark_small.svg/revision/latest?cb=20191123181717\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Robux dark small.svg\" data-image-key=\"Robux_dark_small.svg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span> <span class=\"tickets-amount\" style=\"font-weight:bold\">26,000</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sic transit gloria mundi...</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical Details</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Id</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">31101391</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"asset_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">AssetType</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Hat</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_updated\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><small>Page last updated on <b>July 9, 2026</b></small></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Dominus Infernus</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Limited_unique\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Limited unique\">limited unique</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Hat\" title=\"Hat\">hat</a> that was published in the <a href=\"/wiki/Marketplace\" title=\"Marketplace\">marketplace</a> by <a href=\"/wiki/Player:Roblox\" title=\"Player:Roblox\">Roblox</a> <span class=\"wds-dropdown custom-tooltip\"><span class=\"wds-dropdown&#95;&#95;toggle\" style=\"text-decoration:underline dashed #aaa\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><img alt=\"Roblox Admin Badge\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/2/26/Roblox_Admin_Badge.svg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/12?cb=20260320203804\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Roblox Admin Badge.svg\" data-image-key=\"Roblox_Admin_Badge.svg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></span><span class=\"wds-dropdown&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"padding:5px\"><span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><b>Roblox</b> is the official account representing Roblox Corporation. <a href=\"/wiki/Administrator\" title=\"Administrator\">Learn more</a>.</span></span></span></span> on July 20, 2010. It could have initially been purchased for 26,000 <a href=\"/wiki/Robux\" title=\"Robux\">Robux</a> with 26 copies in stock. It is the second hat in the <a href=\"/wiki/Dominus_(series)\" title=\"Dominus (series)\">Dominus series</a>. As of May 4, 2025, 18 copies exist and it has been <a href=\"/wiki/Favorite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Favorite\">favorited</a> 129,736 times.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Release_history\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Release history</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appearance\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearance</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Contents\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Contents</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Release_history\">Release history</span></h3><table class=\"article-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Location</th><th>Available from</th><th>Available until</th></tr><tr><td><span class=\"wds-dropdown custom-tooltip\"><span class=\"wds-dropdown&#95;&#95;toggle\" style=\"text-decoration:underline dashed #aaa\">Marketplace (limited unique)</span><span class=\"wds-dropdown&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"padding:5px\"><span>This item can be purchased in the <a href=\"/wiki/Marketplace\" title=\"Marketplace\">Marketplace</a> and can be resold by owners. <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Accessories_obtained_in_the_Marketplace\" title=\"Category:Accessories obtained in the Marketplace\">See all (9862)</a> <b><big>·</big></b> <a href=\"/wiki/Special:RandomInCategory/Accessories_obtained_in_the_Marketplace\" title=\"Special:RandomInCategory/Accessories obtained in the Marketplace\">Random</a></span></span></span></td><td>July 20, 2010</td><td>Still available</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>It is a black hood with glowing streaks of red lightning searing across the left and right side, while the shoulder rings are an orangish-yellow color. The feathers are tipped with spots of red at the end which are preceded by black lines that separate the red tips from the rest of the feathers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Contents\">Contents</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible\">\n<caption>Item Contents\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">Texture<br />\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">Mesh\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/0/00/Dominus_Infernus_Texture.png/revision/latest?cb=20260609075502\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dominus Infernus Texture\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/0/00/Dominus_Infernus_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20260609075502\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dominus Infernus Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Dominus_Infernus_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><hr /><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://create.roblox.com/store/asset/31100020/\">31100020</a><br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/a/a3/Dominus_Infernus_Mesh.png/revision/latest?cb=20260608140317\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dominus Infernus Mesh\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dominus Infernus Mesh.png\" data-image-key=\"Dominus_Infernus_Mesh.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/roblox/images/a/a3/Dominus_Infernus_Mesh.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20260608140317\" /></a></span><hr /><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://create.roblox.com/store/asset/21057410/\">21057410</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p><i>This section is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Trivia_sections\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:Trivia sections\">trivia section</a>. Please <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Handling_trivia#Recommendations_for_handling_trivia\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:Handling trivia\">relocate</a> any relevant information into other sections of the article.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Its description translates to \"Thus passes the glory of the world.\"</li>\n<li>This item is a <a href=\"/wiki/Retexture\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Retexture\">retexture</a> that was originally made by the user <a href=\"/wiki/Player:SampleCreator\" title=\"Player:SampleCreator\">SampleCreator</a>.</li>\n<li>It was considered more valuable than the <a href=\"/wiki/Catalog:Dominus_Frigidus\" title=\"Catalog:Dominus Frigidus\">Dominus Frigidus</a> by external trading communities until 2014.</li>\n<li>The serial #15 copy of the Dominus Infernus was deleted from <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://rblx.trade/p/sampleowner\">SampleOwner</a>'s inventory.</li></ul></div>",
